  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Alcohol Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A nondrying, buildable lip liner that creates soft definition or sheer, all-over color for comfortable, hydrated, and natural-looking lips.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Jojoba Complex: Supports skin barrier function for smooth, healthy-looking lips.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Glide pencil along your lip line to subtly define and shape lips.<br>-Use all over for a sheer wash of color.<br>-Use on its own or with your favorite Signature Lip or Shade Slick shade (each sold separately).<br>-Use the built-in sharpener to sharpen the retractable tip when needed.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Rose and June: Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxyphenyl Dimethicone, Diisostearyl Malate, Synthetic Wax, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Octyldodecanol, Dicalcium Phosphate, C20-24 Alkyl Dimethicone, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Cera Carnauba (Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Cire de Carnauba), Disteardimonium Hectorite, Punica Granatum Flower Extract, Propylene Carbonate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Moringa Oleifera Seed Oil, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, tocopherol, May Contain/Peut Contenir: CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 77491/ CI 77492 (Iron Oxides), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake), CI 15850 (Red 6), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake).</div></details>",
